+/* Rosetta runs a single-stepped (EFLAGS.TF) 32-bit "call rel32" (E8) as a
+ * 64-bit call: it pushes an 8-byte return address, so Esp ends 8 lower
+ * instead of 4 and the callee finds a zero dword where the caller's last
